# Cargo features for the nano-rs/vector image (NAN-3604): only the components nano ships or
# renders, plus the runtime pieces they need. Built with --no-default-features.
#
# Derived from `scan-components.py` (see REBASE.md, "Component set"). The image's `vector list`
# must equal COMPONENTS exactly; the nano-image workflow's parity job checks it.
# One feature per line; `#` starts a comment. The Dockerfile joins the lines with commas.

# --- runtime (the non-component part of upstream's target-<triple>-unknown-linux-gnu set) ---
# GraphQL API + health endpoint: [api] enabled in the platform base; `vector top` / `vector tap`.
api
api-client
# Allocator, as upstream's Linux release targets.
tikv-jemallocator
# Full VRL standard library (crypto, env, network, system functions): tenant parser VRL may use
# any stdlib function, and the platform VRL uses get_env_var and sha2.
vrl/stdlib
# Parquet batch encoding of the Bronze sink (ocsf_parquet_bronze); brings codecs-arrow.
codecs-parquet
# Enrichment tables, kept for NAN-3489 (all enrichment traverses Vector; the lake-lane IPinfo
# MMDB lookup is a candidate to move into VRL). The `file` (CSV) table is always built in.
enrichment-tables-geoip
enrichment-tables-mmdb
enrichment-tables-memory

# --- sources ---
# Pull sources (nanosiem tenant_bundle/pull.rs, nano-main pull-bundle.ts).
sources-aws_s3
sources-aws_sqs
sources-azure_event_hubs
sources-gcp_pubsub
# Classic / open-core Kafka sources (nanosiem source_configs generate_kafka_source, emitted at
# runtime; SASL PLAIN / SCRAM-SHA-256/512 over SASL_SSL). librdkafka is built from source with
# cmake, as upstream's Linux release targets do. GSSAPI is NOT enabled (no nano config offers
# it), so libsasl2 is not linked. Hosted pull no longer renders kafka (NAN-3604).
sources-kafka
rdkafka?/cmake_build
# Push ingest (platform base, cells, open core).
sources-http_server
sources-opentelemetry
sources-splunk_hec
sources-vector
# Self-observability.
sources-internal_logs
sources-internal_metrics
# Region log shipper DaemonSet (nano-main hosted-shared-region-log-shipping.ts).
sources-kubernetes_logs
# The base bundle's opt-in templates (sources/{file,syslog}.toml.disabled).
sources-file
sources-syslog
# NAN-3489 thin pullers (vendor API polling through the tenant Vector).
sources-http_client
# Test harnesses that run this image (pipe_native_tests.rs, verify-vector-generation-rollback.sh).
sources-demo_logs
sources-stdin

